ine></svg></div></div></a><a href="/beschwerden/rueckenschmerzen/" class="svc-card reveal"><div class="svc-photo-top-bar"></div><div class="svc-photo-wrap"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/img-f7f113048735.webp" alt="Rückenschmerzen mit TCM behandeln | TCM.ch" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;position:absolute;inset:0;"></div><div class="svc-body"><div class="svc-name">Rückenschmerzen</div><div class="svc-tagline">Häufig bei Verspannungen, Bandscheibenproblemen und chronischen Beschwerden</div><div class="svc-cta">Mehr erfahren <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg></div></div></a><a href="/beschwerden/nackenschmerzen/" class="svc-card reveal"><div class="svc-photo-top-bar"></div><div class="svc-photo-wrap"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/img-fce33d67fc98.webp" alt="Nackenschmerzen mit TCM behandeln | TCM.ch" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;position:absolute;inset:0;"></div><div class="svc-body"><div class="svc-name">Nackenschmerzen</div><div class="svc-tagline">Verspannungen lösen, Beweglichkeit zurückgewinnen</div><div class="svc-cta">Mehr erfahren <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg></div></div></a><a href="/beschwerden/hexenschuss/" class="svc-card reveal"><div class="svc-photo-top-bar"></div><div class="svc-photo-wrap"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/img-5db981915fc8.webp" alt="Hexenschuss mit TCM behandeln | TCM.ch" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;position:absolute;inset:0;"></div><div class="svc-body"><div class="s