ound"><path d="M13 2L4.5 13H11.5L11 22L19.5 11H12.5L13 2z"></path></svg></span> <div><div style="font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--black)">Elektroakupunktur</div> <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">Verstärkte Akupunktur durch elektrische Impulse, besonders bei Schmerzen</div></div> </div><div class="sidebar-row" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)" onclick="nav('therapie','akupressur')"> <span style="font-size:18px"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle><path d="M12 2v3M12 19v3M2 12h3M19 12h3"></path><path d="M5.6 5.6l2.1 2.1M16.3 16.3l2.1 2.1M5.6 18.4l2.1-2.1M16.3 7.7l2.1-2.1"></path></svg></span> <div><div style="font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--black)">Akupressur</div> <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">Sanfte Stimulation der Akupunkturpunkte ohne Nadeln, ideal für empfindliche Patienten</div></div> </div><div class="sidebar-row" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)" onclick="nav('therapie','shiatsu')"> <span style="font-size:18px"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3C7 3 3 7 3 12s4 9 9 9 9-4 9-9-4-9-9-9z"></path><path d="M12 8v4l3 3"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg></span> <div><div style="font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--black)">Shiatsu</div> <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">Japanische Druckmassage entlang der Energiebahnen für tiefe Entspannung und Balance</div></div> </div><div class="sidebar-row" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)" onclick="nav('therapie','gua-sha')"> <span style="font-size:18px"><svg widt