hneknirschen mit TCM behandeln | TCM.ch" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;position:absolute;inset:0;"></div><div class="svc-body"><div class="svc-name">Zähneknirschen</div><div class="svc-tagline">Kaumuskulatur und Anspannung lösen</div><div class="svc-cta">Mehr erfahren <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg></div></div></a></div></div></section></div> <div id="symptom-fallback-cta"><section class="fallback-cta-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="fallback-cta-inner"> <div class="fallback-cta-text"> <h3>Nicht sicher, was du brauchst?</h3> <p>Beschreibe kurz deine Situation, wir empfehlen dir die passende Therapie und Praxis.</p> </div> <div class="fallback-cta-btns"> <a href="https://wa.me/41775236122" class="btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" style="display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;flex-shrink:0"><path d="M13 2L4.5 13H11.5L11 22L19.5 11H12.5L13 2z"></path></svg>Per WhatsApp</a>  </div> </div></div></section></div> <section class="section contact-section-inline" style="background:var(--surface)"> <div class="wrap"> <div class="contact-inline-grid"> <div class="reveal"> <div class="section-label">Passende Hilfe finden</div> <h2 class="section-title">Jetzt passende <em>Hilfe anfragen.</em></h2> <p class="section-sub" style="margin-bottom:0">Kurz schildern, wir helfen dir beim passenden nächsten Schritt.</p> <div class="intake-trust-row"> <div class="intake-trust-item"><span class="intake-trust-dot"></span>Passende Praxis statt langem Suchen</div> <div class="intake-trust-item"><span class="intake-trust-dot"></span>Standorte in der Deutschschweiz</div> <div class="intake-trust-item"><span class="intake-trust-dot"></span>Krankenkassenanerkannt (Zusatzversicherung)</div> </div> <div class="contact-methods-mini" style="gap:8px"> <a href="https://wa.me/41775236122" class="contact-method-mini" target="_blank"> <div class="cm-icon-mini cm-wa"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="white"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413z"></path></svg></div> <div><strong>WhatsApp, sofort starten</strong><span>Persönliche Antwort vom Team</span></div> </a> <a href="tel:+41775236122" class="contact-method-mini phone-quiet"> <div class="cm-icon-mini cm-phone"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07A19.5 19.5 0 0 1 4.69 12 19.79 19.79 0 0 1 1.62 3.42 2 2 0 0 1 3.6 1.25h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L7.91 8.82a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l.92-.92a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907